{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/statistics-probability/permutations-combinations/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/statistics-probability/permutations-combinations.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Permutations & Combinations","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<header class=\"bg-emerald-700 text-white py-3 mb-6\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"font-semibold\">Permutations &amp; Combinations</div><a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/statistics-probability/\" class=\"text-white/90\">Back</a></div>\n  </header>\n  <main class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-6\">\n    <section class=\"card\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Ordered vs Unordered</h2><div class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">Permutations count arrangements where order matters; combinations count selections where order doesn't matter.</div></section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Illustration</h2>\n      <div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-gray-700\">Arrangement (permutation) of ABC choosing 2: AB, AC, BA, BC, CA, CB — 6 ways. Selection (combination) of 2 from ABC: AB, AC, BC — 3 ways.</div>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 flex justify-center\">\n        <!-- simple SVG showing permutations vs combinations -->\n        <svg width=\"340\" height=\"120\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"150\" height=\"90\" fill=\"#d1fae5\" stroke=\"#10b981\" rx=\"8\"></rect>\n          <text x=\"85\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#065f46\">Permutations (order)</text>\n          <text x=\"85\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AB, AC, BA, BC, CA, CB</text>\n          <rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"150\" height=\"90\" fill=\"#e6fffa\" stroke=\"#06b6d4\" rx=\"8\"></rect>\n          <text x=\"255\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#065f46\">Combinations (no order)</text>\n          <text x=\"255\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AB, AC, BC</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Practice</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-3\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">1) Arrange 3 letters from ABCD (ordered)</div><input id=\"p1\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 24\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"pc1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-700 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"ph1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"pfb1\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">2) Choose 2 from 5 (combinations)</div><input id=\"p2\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 10\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"pc2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-700 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"ph2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"pfb2\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"text-right\"><button id=\"pcQuiz\" class=\"bg-emerald-700 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded\">Quiz</button></div>\n  </main>\n\n  <div id=\"pcModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 z-40 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded p-6 max-w-md w-full\"><div id=\"pcContent\"></div><div class=\"mt-4 text-right\"><button id=\"pcClose\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Close</button></div></div></div>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-emerald-50 font-sans","bodyStyle":"","css":[".card{background:#fff;padding:1rem;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.06)} .mono{font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, \"Roboto Mono\", monospace}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}